Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.91,0:02:25.62,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}不知何时  伤口已经痊愈 yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:28.71,OPCN-CHS,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\be3}Woo
